{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethereia, Khaza was an elf known for her extraordinary connection to the rare and exquisite tillandsia plants. She spent most of her days tending to these epiphytes, coaxing them to thrive in the most unlikely of places. Khaza's people believed that tillandsias held the secrets of the air and the whispers of the wind. As she cared for the plants, she would listen to their gentle hum, gaining wisdom and insight into the world around her. Her love for tillandsias led her to discover hidden waterfalls and secret gardens, where she would cultivate these plants and share their beauty with the rest of the realm. Khaza's dedication to the tillandsias earned her the title of 'Airweaver,' and her people would often seek her guidance on matters of the heart and the balance of nature.",
